<urn:atm:triage:finding/AX5-QA1-013>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AX5-QA1-013" ;
  triage:title "release_streaks map leaks a residual entry for a member below the release-streak threshold who permanently leaves the roster" ;
  triage:description "AX.5 QA-1 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r1, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T12:38Z) at head da823baaa0018933f8daac388733c51eb14e9335. rust-service-hardening-agent RSH-004: release_streaks (crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:66, updated at :910/:939) has no removal path tied to roster membership, so a member who accumulates a sub-threshold streak and then leaves the roster leaves a permanent entry. Fix: prune release_streaks entries for members absent from the current roster snapshot each tick (can share the pruning added for AX5-QA1-006)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ax" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "RSH" ;
  triage:severity "minor" ;
